{"id":"650879","name":"凉拌青瓜虾仁","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/650879/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜虾洗净上锅大火蒸熟后晾凉，晾凉后去壳备用。","img":"images/650879/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/650879/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菜洗净切段备用。","img":"images/650879/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗中放入蒜末，辣椒粉，烧烤料，盐，鸡精。","img":"images/650879/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淋上热油激发出香味。","img":"images/650879/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，陈醋和生抽。","img":"images/650879/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/650879/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"青瓜洗净后拍碎切段。","img":"images/650879/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将青瓜和虾仁放入碗中。","img":"images/650879/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入香菜。","img":"images/650879/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋上调好的凉拌汁，抓匀冷藏一小时入味。","img":"images/650879/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650879/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650879/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650879/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/650879/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}